<view class="page"><view class="business-tabs sticky-tabs"><view class="tab-indicator tab-{{activeSection}}"></view><view class="business-tab {{activeSection === 0 ? 'active' : ''}}" data-index="0" bindtap="jumpSection">校园套餐</view><view class="business-tab {{activeSection === 1 ? 'active' : ''}}" data-index="1" bindtap="jumpSection">话费权益</view><view class="business-tab {{activeSection === 2 ? 'active' : ''}}" data-index="2" bindtap="jumpSection">宽带资格</view></view><view class="official card"><view class="official-label">校园通信服务</view><view class="official-title">校园电话卡，在线直接下单</view><view class="official-copy">提交后进入实名/到账跟进，客服将在24小时内联系。</view></view><view class="form card"><view class="form-tip">办理人信息</view><view class="field"><input class="input" placeholder="姓名" value="{{profileName}}" bindinput="setProfileName" /></view><view class="field"><input class="input" type="number" maxlength="11" placeholder="本人手机号" value="{{profilePhone}}" bindinput="setProfilePhone" /></view></view><view id="plansSection" class="section-title business-section">1 · 选择校园套餐</view><view class="plans"><view wx:for="{{plans}}" wx:key="id" class="plan card {{selectedPlan === index ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="choosePlan"><view class="plan-top"><view><view class="plan-name">{{item.name}}</view><view class="plan-badge">{{item.badge}}</view></view><view><text class="plan-price">¥{{item.monthlyFee}}</text><text class="muted">/月</text></view></view><view class="plan-benefits"><text>{{item.data}}</text><text>{{item.voice}}</text></view></view></view><view class="form card"><view class="form-tip">当前选中：{{plans[selectedPlan].name}}</view><button class="primary-button" loading="{{submitting}}" disabled="{{submitting}}" bindtap="submit">{{submitting ? '提交中…' : '提交电话卡订单'}}</button></view><view id="rechargeSection" class="section-title promo-heading business-section"><text>2 · 限时话费权益</text><text class="limited">已购可加</text></view><view class="recharge-grid"><view wx:for="{{rechargePromos}}" wx:key="id" class="recharge-card card"><view class="recharge-badge">{{item.badge}}</view><view class="recharge-title">充{{item.pay}}元</view><view class="recharge-value">到账 <text>¥{{item.receive}}</text></view><button size="mini" class="recharge-button" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="buyRecharge">提交活动</button></view></view><view class="recharge-note muted">用已办理电话卡的号码下单后，系统会自动关联同号码套餐订单，方便客服一起跟进到账。</view><view id="broadbandSection" class="section-title business-section">3 · 双人购卡宽带资格</view><view class="broadband card"><view class="broadband-title">两位同学购卡，提交宽带核验</view><view class="muted broadband-copy">填写同伴号码后提交，客服核验双方资格。</view><view class="field"><input class="input" type="number" maxlength="11" placeholder="同伴手机号" value="{{companionPhone}}" bindinput="setCompanionPhone" /></view><button class="ghost-button" bindtap="applyBroadband">提交宽带资格</button></view><view class="tips"><view class="tips-title">办理说明</view><view>· 套餐与活动以运营商最终确认结果为准</view><view>· 正式激活需本人完成实名核验</view></view></view>
